    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495320/extras/6b06026f9db977cb2ace2b21f534f82f.avif?t=1746828210\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Carnal Instinct </strong> is an Adult RPG with an emphasis on <strong>AAA quality visuals</strong> and <strong>compelling erotic interaction</strong>. The Steam version of the game is the most stable, and gets consistent updates, including\u00a0<strong>huge</strong> content updates at least four times per year (approximately once per quarter, precise release timings will vary depending on update complexity). <i>For full details of the most recent update please check the news section.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495320/extras/d395fb41f98b388416d306cdcf0ea80c.webp?t=1746828210\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our journey begins in a realm of ancient myth, where the life-giving waters of the Euphoris river meet the sand-swept ruins of Sabu. The God-Queen Kethra has not been seen for a thousand years, but rumors of her return are uttered in hushed tones throughout the sprawling villages along the shoreline of the once mighty waterway. Deprived of its divine empress, Sabu has fallen under the rule of  demigods, powerful beings that once served Kethra as bodyguards. Unchecked, these immortals now vie for power as warlords, their conquest bathing Sabu with the blood of the innocent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495320/extras/bfd5d18938a1aa5e4b37a677bafb636c.poster.avif?t=1746828210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495320/extras/bfd5d18938a1aa5e4b37a677bafb636c.webm?t=1746828210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495320/extras/bfd5d18938a1aa5e4b37a677bafb636c.mp4?t=1746828210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You enter this world as a slave, a prisoner of fate and the cruelty of others, but you will find that your future is as changeable as the sands of Sabu. The path of fate is yours to tread and your story is not yet written...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495320/extras/d395fb41f98b388416d306cdcf0ea80c.webp?t=1746828210\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game currently features playable <strong>Human</strong>, <strong>Feline</strong>, <strong>Jackal</strong>, <strong>Crocodilian,</strong> and <strong>Draconic</strong> races on the first steps of their ascent to godhood; living echoes of the deities themselves. As your power increases and development of the project continues, so too will you be able to shape your body - from one which retains the majority of your once-human form, to the humanoid animal deities that ruled Sabu in centuries past, or finally adopt the truly primal presence of the ancient gods (Centaur, Naga, Sphynx, and more). Male, Female, and Futa options are all available in-game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495320/extras/5f1ce15a88a30d76d301cd768cbcab9a.poster.avif?t=1746828210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495320/extras/5f1ce15a88a30d76d301cd768cbcab9a.webm?t=1746828210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495320/extras/5f1ce15a88a30d76d301cd768cbcab9a.mp4?t=1746828210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customisation extends beyond skins and species, with all manner of sliders allowing customisation of many facets of your character's form...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495320/extras/5d0ec6f5000c4b651dd8ff42167f140b.poster.avif?t=1746828210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495320/extras/5d0ec6f5000c4b651dd8ff42167f140b.webm?t=1746828210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495320/extras/5d0ec6f5000c4b651dd8ff42167f140b.mp4?t=1746828210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495320/extras/cfb2e0563256a6b67e9e2942414b58f3.poster.avif?t=1746828210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495320/extras/cfb2e0563256a6b67e9e2942414b58f3.webm?t=1746828210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our erotic content spans the tame foothills of vanilla lovemaking, all the way to the depraved peaks of the most extreme carnal desires. Our adult features are more than mere titillation or something to while away the hours, sex links directly into quests and vice versa. Want to improve relations or recruit an NPC to join your camp? Bending over or kneeling down might get them exactly where you want them to be. As you begin to bend Sabu to your will so you will draw attention from those who wish to submit to your lust, or tame you to indulge their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495320/extras/7c5c111b1831ac7925b9455a54d7d45a.poster.avif?t=1746828210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495320/extras/7c5c111b1831ac7925b9455a54d7d45a.webm?t=1746828210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495320/extras/7c5c111b1831ac7925b9455a54d7d45a.mp4?t=1746828210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495320/extras/d395fb41f98b388416d306cdcf0ea80c.webp?t=1746828210\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Carnal Instinct </strong>contains <strong>Anthro</strong> and <strong>Human</strong> content, catering to a wide range of preferences and desires. You can enable and disable sexual content to meet your taste, nothing is mandatory and you can choose who you decide to be intimate with and on what terms. The form into which you shape your body will dictate what options are open to you, with the more exotic forms allowing more niche sexual opportunities... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495320/extras/ca7e2d8b3c1043b5eb5c3f33677192ad.poster.avif?t=1746828210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495320/extras/ca7e2d8b3c1043b5eb5c3f33677192ad.webm?t=1746828210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\